        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9om5vj-qfbonkk",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "Services not listed in the itinerary."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:7d924e4146560d1e",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "615714455c7e5176a166ac8bf8dd4885461e95bfcf65ba9eca6314ff279ad46f",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9om5vj-qfbonkk",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "1. To travel to Ecuador, your passport must be valid for at least 6 months after the date you leave Ecuador. It must be in good condition, with no liquid damage, large stains, or torn or missing pages."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:2923c89549a7e445",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "24f614da6b812ccc36f78fbaaf08ad04b9d75042970e5646121d88468f906395",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9om5vj-qfbonkk",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "2. If you continue to another country after visiting Ecuador, you will be asked at check-in in Ecuador to show your flight home from the country you are flying to. You must have a printed or electronic copy of your full flight itinerary."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:ea42fce92725a721",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d73bfac919da165e5c86368d7b23a709a7110df41d23b6d9a657f11688691be1",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9om5vj-qfbonkk",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "3. To fly from Ecuador to destinations in Central America or the Caribbean, you must have an international yellow fever vaccination certificate. Panama and Colombia are exceptions. The requirement still applies if you visit another country between Ecuador and your destination in Central America or the Caribbean."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:0d42db9a8212d5d1",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "5721c9ce807fab34c06d6b0be1c6e5ed3d8bd9d99d76e995fd55a2051d84cf80",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9om5vj-qfbonkk",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "PLEASE NOTE: RATES BEFORE BOOKING AND THE TOUR ITINERARY ARE SUBJECT TO CHANGE WITHOUT PRIOR NOTICE."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:c95a4e477ec52974",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "94eb671c9790fb0db6313b74900514dcd3d01452b293683f6b351445312fc9ca",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9om5vj-qfbonkk",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "Kayaking and the mule ride back up at Quilotoa cost extra. Mule rides are usually available until around 15:00."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:2abc99d75e28d4d7",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d2a97bbcd8855b152a3985c7651652ac37e89cb8aff560121dfdde979ab5a472",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9om5vj-qfbonkk",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "The canopy tour over Pastaza Canyon costs an additional USD 15 per person."
    }
  ]
